          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-21329 rustreapi: gate the volatile calls on the bindings",
        "message": "LU-21329 rustreapi: gate the volatile calls on the bindings\n\nrustreapi does not build against 2.17.50-2.17.58 headers:\n\"cannot find function `llapi_file_open_volatile_param`\".  LU-18842\ngated its volatile calls on LUSTRE_2_18, which lu-version sets for\nany 2.17.50 or later, but the calls first ship in 2.17.59.\n\nAs LU-20663 does for the stripe pattern union, probe the generated\nbindings for llapi_file_open_volatile_param() instead of the\nversion.  The calls are in rustreapi, so lustreapi-sys passes the\nresult on as links metadata, which rustreapi's build.rs turns into\nthe has_file_open_volatile cfg.\n\nFixes: a67f003e5bb6 (\"LU-18842 llapi: create volatile file with a layout\")\nSigned-off-by: Robert Read <rread@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Id871ab62f79c267a603bf167ad667991a59cd8b8\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
